          "data": {
            "uid": "40f67422-18eb-4140-b27d-0b0cf49a6d23",
            "note": "A fast, local-only schedule and degree planner for UDST students. Runs entirely on `http://localhost:8787` on your own Windows PC — **no admin rights required**, **no third-party servers**, and **writes to PeopleSoft are OFF by default** until you explicitly review and click Apply.\n\n_Draft outline imported from https://github.com/t2-titto/udst-schedule-planner. Check it against the code before relying on it._",
            "text": "Overview",
            "engineering": {
